{"sectionId":"stereo/chirality","items":[{"id":"stereo--chirality-k001","sectionId":"stereo/chirality","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"키랄 분자는 거울상과 겹쳐지지 않는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--chirality-k002","sectionId":"stereo/chirality","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"사면체 입체중심의 R/S 배정은 CIP 규칙에 따라 직접 결합 원자의 원자번호, 동위원소 질량, 다음 원자 배열 등을 비교한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--chirality-k003","sectionId":"stereo/chirality","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"최저 우선순위를 뒤로 두고 1→2→3이 시계방향이면 R, 반시계면 S이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--chirality-k004","sectionId":"stereo/chirality","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"R/S와 광회전 부호 (+)/(−)는 독립이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--chirality-k005","sectionId":"stereo/chirality","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"enantiomer는 비중첩 거울상이고 diastereomer는 거울상 관계가 아닌 입체이성질체다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--chirality-k006","sectionId":"stereo/chirality","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"n개 독립 입체중심의 최대 입체이성질체 수는 2ⁿ이지만 대칭성으로 감소할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--chirality-k007","sectionId":"stereo/chirality","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"meso 화합물은 입체중심이 있어도 분자 전체가 비키랄이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--chirality-k008","sectionId":"stereo/chirality","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"라세미 혼합물은 두 enantiomer가 같은 양으로 존재하는 혼합물이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--chirality-k009","sectionId":"stereo/chirality","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"enantiomeric excess ee=|%R−%S|로 계산한다(두 enantiomer 기준).","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--chirality-k010","sectionId":"stereo/chirality","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"E/Z는 이중결합 각 탄소의 높은 CIP 우선순위 치환기가 반대쪽이면 E, 같은 쪽이면 Z이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--chirality-k011","sectionId":"stereo/chirality","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"R/S는 절대배치, E/Z는 이중결합 기하.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--chirality-k012","sectionId":"stereo/chirality","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"cis/trans와 E/Z는 항상 일대일 대응하지 않는다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--chirality-k013","sectionId":"stereo/chirality","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"meso는 단일 비키랄 화합물, racemate는 혼합물이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--chirality-k014","sectionId":"stereo/chirality","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"비키랄 환경에서 거울상 이성질체는 대체로 같은 물리적 성질을 보인다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"stereo--chirality-k015","sectionId":"stereo/chirality","unitId":"stereo","subject":"chemistry","text":"60%이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]}]}